1
00:00:06,589 --> 00:00:09,179
- What are you doing?
- Oh, Priya's calling in a few minutes...

2
00:00:09,342 --> 00:00:11,802
(Leonard:)...on Skype
and we are gonna have a dinner date.

3
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:16,227
It's 8:00 in the morning in Mumbai.

4
00:00:16,391 --> 00:00:18,351
(Sheldon:)How can she have dinner?

5
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:20,852
(Leonard:)Whatever.
Priya will be having breakfast.

6
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:24,151
(Sheldon:)All right.
So technically, it's not a dinner date.

7
00:00:24,315 --> 00:00:27,605
(Sheldon:)I suppose you could call it
a, uh, dinfast date.

8
00:00:28,153 --> 00:00:31,033
But if you did, you'd open yourseIf
to peer-based mocking...

9
00:00:31,197 --> 00:00:34,947
...such as, "Hey, Leonard, how was
your dinfast with Priya last night?"

10
00:00:35,118 --> 00:00:36,868
(Leonard:)That doesn't sound like mocking.

11
00:00:37,037 --> 00:00:38,537
(Sheldon:)You didn't let me finish.

12
00:00:38,705 --> 00:00:40,835
(Sheldon:)Dinfast.

13
00:00:41,332 --> 00:00:42,912
(Sheldon:)Are those soy-based candles?

14
00:00:43,084 --> 00:00:44,504
(Leonard:)I don't know. Why?

15
00:00:44,669 --> 00:00:47,299
(Sheldon:)Paraffin candles
may contain carcinogens.

16
00:00:47,464 --> 00:00:52,054
(Sheldon:)Unless lung cancer is the ambiance
you were going for at your dinfast.

17
00:00:53,053 --> 00:00:54,383
(Sheldon:)Dinfast.

18
00:00:56,222 --> 00:00:59,062
I don't wanna be rude,
but Priya's gonna be calling, so...

19
00:00:59,225 --> 00:01:00,725
(Sheldon:)Oh, yes. Priya.

20
00:01:00,894 --> 00:01:04,434
(Sheldon:)Leonard, you know I make a point...

